{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport math\ns=1/3; d=s*s; C=(1-d)/s; D=-s\n# moments integral Y=-ln(t/d)-1 over t from a to d; use u=a/d\n# integral Y, Y2 formulas over s variable u..1\nfor u in [0,.001,.01,.05,.1,.2,.4,.6,.8,.9,.99]:\n a=d*u; L=1-a\n if u==0:\n  I1=0; I2=d # Y moments over full block: mean0, second1 times d\n else:\n  # integrals over x in [u,1] y=-ln x -1\n  # primitive y: -x ln x\n  I1x=u*math.log(u)\n  # integrate y² = (lnx+1)\"'^2: primitive x[(lnx)''^2+?]\n  # E over u..1: full integral 1; subtract 0..u integral; int0u y² dx = u*((-math.log(u)-1)**2+1)?? Exp truncated: integral0u (X-1)''^2 dx where X=-ln x; formula u[(L)''^2+2L+2 -2(L+1)+1]=u(L²+1)\n  LL=-math.log(u)\n  I2x=1-u*(LL*LL+1)\n  I1=d*(I1x + C*(1-u)); I2=d*(I2x+2*C*(I1x)+(C*C)*(1-u))\n  # I1x integral y; yes\n  # if u=0 formulas\n  \n  \n # outside integrals\n if u==0:\n  I1=d*C + (1-d)*D # total 0\n  I2=d*(1+C*C)+(1-d)*D*D\n else:\n  I1=d*(I1x+C*(1-u))+(1-d)*D\n  I2=d*(I2x+2*C*I1x+C*C*(1-u))+(1-d)*D*D\n mean=I1/L; var=I2/L-mean*mean\n print(u,var)\nPY'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_44","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport math\ns=1/3; d=s*s; C=(1-d)/s; D=-s\n# moments integral Y=-ln(t/d)-1 over t from a to d; use u=a/d\n# integral Y, Y2 formulas over s variable u..1\nfor u in [0,.001,.01,.05,.1,.2,.4,.6,.8,.9,.99]:\n a=d*u; L=1-a\n if u==0:\n  I1=0; I2=d # Y moments over full block: mean0, second1 times d\n else:\n  # integrals over x in [u,1] y=-ln x -1\n  # primitive y: -x ln x\n  I1x=u*math.log(u)\n  # integrate y² = (lnx+1)\"'^2: primitive x[(lnx)''^2+?]\n  # E over u..1: full integral 1; subtract 0..u integral; int0u y² dx = u*((-math.log(u)-1)**2+1)?? Exp truncated: integral0u (X-1)''^2 dx where X=-ln x; formula u[(L)''^2+2L+2 -2(L+1)+1]=u(L²+1)\n  LL=-math.log(u)\n  I2x=1-u*(LL*LL+1)\n  I1=d*(I1x + C*(1-u)); I2=d*(I2x+2*C*(I1x)+(C*C)*(1-u))\n  # I1x integral y; yes\n  # if u=0 formulas\n  \n  \n # outside integrals\n if u==0:\n  I1=d*C + (1-d)*D # total 0\n  I2=d*(1+C*C)+(1-d)*D*D\n else:\n  I1=d*(I1x+C*(1-u))+(1-d)*D\n  I2=d*(I2x+2*C*I1x+C*C*(1-u))+(1-d)*D*D\n mean=I1/L; var=I2/L-mean*mean\n print(u,var)\nPY'","aggregated_output":"0 0.9999999999999999\n0.001 0.9898122299998501\n0.01 0.9411140915558565\n0.05 0.8198777467470375\n0.1 0.7194278911021085\n0.2 0.5749854510778435\n0.4 0.37513113316481494\n0.6 0.22731194471232333\n0.8 0.1057819409456261\n0.9 0.05134139511779409\n0.99 0.005012586448856313\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
